<title>USA: St. Paul Cos insurance unit COO resigns.</title>
<headline>St. Paul Cos insurance unit COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>St. Paul Cos said Thursday Nicholas Brown resigned as executive vice president and chief operating officer of St. Paul Fire and Marine Insurance Co.</p>
<p>It said Brown accepted the position of president and chief executive officer of NAC Reinsurance Corp and president and chief operating officer of NAC Re Corp, its holding company.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
